+    """EXPERIMENT (2026-11-18): VLLM_HC_MXFP8=1 quantises the HC low-rank projections online to MXFP8
+    (block-32 scales, weight-only, BF16 activations via b12x's MXFP8 linear kernel - the same path the
+    engine already uses for the LM head). Default: BF16 via cuBLAS, unchanged."""
